    "termsOfAccess": "Usage Terms Summary for the dataset ‘Interviews with migrant and Dutch pastoral caregivers’<br>\nAccess to the restricted files is granted under the following conditions:\n<ul>\n<li>The data must be used exclusively for non-commercial academic research or ecclesial purposes.\n<li>Users must uphold the highest ethical standards, particularly given the sensitive nature of the content (data from migrant pastoral caregivers and about migrant couples and intercultural couples).\n<li>The data must not be shared with others. Access is granted for individual use only. \n<li>Users agree to take full responsibility for protecting the dignity and rights of the individuals represented in the data.\n<li>Use of the data must comply with relevant data protection laws and institutional ethical guidelines.\n<li>Users must cite the following publication in any outputs, publications, or presentations resulting from use of the dataset: tba.\n</ul>\nBy requesting access, users confirm that they have read and agreed to these conditions. Access requests from users affiliated with educational institutions may be approved directly. Other requests will be reviewed on a case-by-case basis.\n",
